  "text": "Title: Who Dares Wins\n\nLeon loved the motto of the British Special Air Service: Who Dares Wins. He lived by this \ntenet, embracing the price of authenticity: the risks, the fear, the unknown dangers of \nsketchy places and dodgy strangers. He believed in the “Tao of travel, where things just \nflow and you’re carried by a \nrandomness through a string of highly fortunate and unlikely experiences.”",
